# Workspace service: workspaces, links, grants and saved files
error-cfl-audience-invalid = The audience for the Confluence link must be 1 to 500 characters. Check it and try again.
error-cfl-not-approved = The Confluence link can't be switched on until it has been approved.
error-cfl-parent-invalid = The Confluence parent page number must be 1 to 64 digits. Check it and try again.
error-cfl-space-invalid = The Confluence space name must be 1 to 255 characters. Check it and try again.
error-grant-duplicate = That access has already been given for this place. Nothing more to do.
error-grant-place-not-in-workspace = That place isn't part of this workspace. Add it to the workspace first.
error-mail-address-invalid = One of the email addresses isn't valid, or there are more than 200. Check them and try again.
error-mail-domain-invalid = One of the email domains isn't valid, or there are more than 100. Check them and try again.
error-mail-grant-duplicate = That agent already has access to this workspace's email. Nothing more to do.
error-mail-imap-state-invalid = ordin's saved place in the mailbox isn't valid. Try again.
error-mail-link-fields-mismatch = The email link doesn't fit its type. A folder link needs a folder or label and no addresses; a people link needs at least one address or domain and no folder.
error-src-kind-mismatch = That kind of link can't track versions. Choose another kind of link.
error-src-location-invalid = That location isn't valid. Check it and try again.
error-src-name-invalid = That name isn't valid. Choose another name.
error-src-place-mismatch = That location doesn't match the place chosen. Check it and try again.
error-wci-duplicate = That file is already in the working copy.
error-wci-path-invalid = The file location is empty or too long. Check it and try again.
error-wci-version-invalid = The file's version label is empty or too long. Try again.
error-ws-bin-mismatch = The record of when this workspace was put in the bin doesn't fit its state. Try again.
error-ws-datastore-unavailable = ordin can't reach its saved work just now. Try again in a moment.
error-ws-files-failed = ordin couldn't save or read that file. Try again.
error-ws-file-name-invalid = That file name can't be used. Choose a shorter name without slashes.
error-ws-file-too-large = That file is too big to save. The limit is 100 MB.
error-ws-git-remote-invalid = The Git address, branch or folder isn't valid. Check it and try again.
error-ws-grant-not-found = This has already been answered.
error-ws-grant-publish-failed = ordin couldn't apply the new access just now. Try again.
error-ws-item-too-large = That file is too big to open here.
error-ws-jira-address-invalid = That isn't a Jira Cloud issue address. Paste the address of the issue and try again.
error-ws-jira-read-only = Jira issues can only be read, not changed. Choose read-only access.
error-ws-jira-site-mismatch = That issue is on a different Jira site from the one connected. Use an issue from the connected site.
error-ws-jira-unavailable = Jira issues can't be linked on a personal computer. Use a shared ordin instead.
error-ws-link-state-invalid = That link isn't in a state that allows this. Check the link and try again.
error-ws-name-duplicate = A workspace already has that name. Choose another name.
error-ws-name-empty = Give the workspace a name.
error-ws-name-too-long = That name is too long. Use 80 characters or fewer.
error-ws-not-found = ordin can't find that workspace. It may have been removed.
error-ws-not-team = This workspace isn't shared with a team, so it has no team results folder.
error-ws-origin-invalid = That place can't be linked from a team workspace.
error-ws-own-folder-failed = ordin couldn't create a folder for this workspace. Try again.
error-ws-result-path-invalid = That file name can't be shared with the team. Choose a name without special characters that doesn't start with a full stop.
error-ws-result-path-taken = A file with that name is already in the team results folder. Choose another name.
error-ws-state-invalid = That workspace can't be changed that way in its current state.
error-ws-working-copy-item-not-found = ordin can't find that file in the working copy.
error-ws-working-copy-transition-invalid = That file can't be changed that way in its current state.
